    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "PAN AM.\nSchedules\nEffective June 1, 1987\nNEW NONSTOP SERVICE\nNEW YORK-BERLIN\nEXPECT MORE FROM PAN AM",
      "MORE COMFORT\nPAN AM\nMORE SPACE\nYou'll find it in First\nClass. Total comfort in our\nnew Sleeperette® Seats. And\nmore room to relax, stretch\nout, or work in our wider,\nmore handsome Clipper®\nseats with six, not\neight, seats across).\nEnjoy more\ncomfort in\nHelsink\nMeningrad\n* MOSCOW\npenhagen\nPrague\n• Warsaw Krakow\nNuremoero\n/ienna\n•Budapest\nBucharest\nBelgrade\n•Seattle/Tacoma\nMinneapolis/St. Paul.\nChicago Detto\n•San Francisco:\nIndianapolis Cleveland\nNew York/Newark\nPittsburgh®\nCos Angeles\nCincinnati .\nDallas/Ft. Winth Nashville•\nAustin\neigh/Durham\n• Bermud\nHouston:\nSan Antonio,\n›Atlanta\nCharlotte\n• Ortando\nTampa/St. Pete.\n\"Freeport\nGrand Tul\nuerto\nico City\nThomas\nLS Maarten\nGuatemala City×\nSanto Domingo\nSt Croix\n• San Salvador\nSan Joses\nMara bo\nCaracas\nPanama C\n• Barbados\nPort of Spain\n• Tel Aviv/Yafo\nFirst Class. More Comfort in\nClipper Class. More comfort\nin Economy.\nMORE PAMPERING\nYou'll be treated to new\ncarpeting, brighter decor\nbetter lighting, new electronic\nheadsets and more elaborate\nand innovative menus.\nMORE EFFICIENT\nWe're also introducing an\nall new reservation\nsystem which means\nfaster ticketing and\nshorter lines at the\nairport.\nAnd as always you\nget that internationally\namous Pan Am service\nevervwhere vou flv.\nSo if vou\nappreciate comfort,\ncome fly with us. And\nget more.\nEXPECT MORE FROM PAN AM\n• Guayaquil\nSantiago\nMAnt\nBuenos Aires\nHin de laneiro\nSao Paulo\nOPAN AM\nWorldwide Route System"
